#: views/form.php:26
msgid ""
" It executes an HTTP GET passing the caller number as argument to retrieve "
"the correct name"
msgstr " 它會執行 HTTP GET，將呼叫者號碼作為引數傳遞，以取得正確的名稱"

#: views/form.php:27
msgid ""
" It executes an HTTPS GET passing the caller number as argument to retrieve "
